3. Create a new database user

Sometimes the postgres user is restricted. Try:

Shell
sudo -u postgres psql

Create a dedicated Grafana user:

SQL
CREATE USER grafana WITH PASSWORD 'Grafana@123';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE enterprise_ai TO grafana;

Exit:

SQL
\q

Then in Grafana use:

Plain Text
Host: 192.168.11.150:5432
Database: enterprise_ai
User: grafana
Password: Grafana@123
SSL Mode: disable
